        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PAREDNCOM, Single Cylinder Eden Prairie Knob Combo</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGrandeur's Single Cylinder Parthenon Combo With Eden Prairie Knob is the perfect combination of masculine and feminine, simple and ornate. Made out of solid brass, this single cylinder entry set features a classic design that is slightly floral while the beading around the perimeter keeps it from being too soft. The Eden Prairie's egg shape is timeless, its simple design allowing that of the Parthenon Rose and matching deadbolt to shine. This Grandeur Entry Door Combo Pack includes a high security single cylinder deadbolt meaning it is operated by a key on the outside of the door and by a thumbturn on the inside. The Single Cylinder Parthenon Entry Set With Eden Prairie Knob fits doors 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Single Cylinder Parthenon Combo With  Eden Prairie Knob:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Single Cylinder Eden Prairie Knob Combo:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Height: 7.84\"</li>\r\n<li>Parthenon Plate Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 3.34\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.52\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-plate.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EDN-knob.pdf?v=1704262178\" target=\"new\"><b>Eden Prairie Knob Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PAR-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262179\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
